# TDD

Test behavior through public interfaces, not implementation details — good tests survive refactors.
Work in **vertical slices**: one test → minimal code to pass → repeat. Do NOT write all tests
first then all code (horizontal slicing produces tests of imagined behavior). Mock only at system
boundaries, never your own modules. Refactor only when green.
Full guidance and examples: @.cursor/skills/tdd/SKILL.md
